  "content": "\n\n<p><em><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fstarted.ink%252f%253fref%253ddinzeer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1307366/description_392abb66-2c9e-4f55-95dd-036967cf92ac.png\"></strong></a></em></p>\n<p><em>Cialloblade</em>&nbsp;為&nbsp;<em>SlashBlade: Resharped</em>&nbsp;的擴充模組，新增了一把名為&nbsp;<strong>「Senren * Banka」</strong>&nbsp;的全新太刀。此武器具備以下特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>專屬的創意模式頁籤</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>不錯的數值面板，迷人的</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>音效<br>其設計靈感及部分紋理細節皆源自同名視覺小說&nbsp;<em>Senren * Banka</em>&nbsp;。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
